quran[11]{c,v,t}:
  40,67,"He is the One Who initiated your (chemical) genesis from clay, then (your biological genesis) from a fertilised egg (i.e. a zygote*), then from a clinging mass (i.e. the embryo in the mother’s womb). Then He brings you out as infants, then (nourishes you) so that you may reach your maturity. Then He lets you grow old, though some of you (may) die sooner. And (the purpose of all this is) that you may reach an appointed term (in this world). So perhaps you may understand."
  40,68,"He is the One Who gives life and causes death. So when He decides upon a thing, He only says to it: ‘Be!’ And it is."
  40,69,Have you not seen those who dispute the Signs of Allah? Where are they being turned away?
  40,70,(They are) the ones who deny the Book and (the scriptures) that We have sent Our messengers with. But they will soon know (its consequences).
  40,71,"When, with iron shackles and chains around their necks, they will be dragged,"
  40,72,"into the boiling liquid, then burned in the Fire as fuel."
  40,73,"Then they will be told: ‘Where are those (idols) you used to ascribe as partners,"
  40,74,"apart from Allah?’ They will say: ‘They have left us. Rather, we did not use to worship anything before.’ That is how Allah lets the disbelievers go astray."
  40,75,(They will be told:) ‘That is because you used to rejoice in the land unjustly and because you used to act arrogantly.
  40,76,Enter the gates of Hell to remain in it forever.’ So evil is the (final) abode of the arrogant!
  40,77,"So be patient. Allah’s promise is indeed true. Whether We show you a part of (the punishment) that We have promised them (in this life) or We cause you to die (before that), they shall be returned to Us (in either case)."
